# LayoutAreaDataBakeRatchetGuard — layout areas that LOAD data on the hub and BAKE it into controls.
# Format: <repo-relative file><TAB><number of bake units in that file>. SHRINK-ONLY.
# Convert an area to a template that BINDS its data (Doc/GUI/DataBinding → "Templates first, data
# later"), then lower or delete its line and lower TotalBudget in the guard in the same change.
# Never add a line: a new area is born a template.
